    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For its Summer 2026 collection, CELINE introduces the silk scarf Teen Triomphe handbag. Creative Director Michael Rider masterfully blends delicate mulberry silk with structured leather, creating a layered dialogue between materials. The scarf becomes a narrative vehicle, weaving together iconic brand symbols like the Arc de Triomphe, chain links, and carriage crest, imbuing the bag with a romantic, elegant allure.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
