      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/fvvvko0/c8978560dc5fce39.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Scarves are also one of the most eye-catching design elements on Michael Rider's runway. From the debut show invitation to suit lapels, trench coat linings, and flowing skirts, scarves transcend mere accessories. Through twisting, wrapping, and draping, they become part of the garment's structure, outlining a visual tension between sensuality and restraint, and adding a graceful, rhythmic movement to the silhouette.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
