    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crafted from tan calfskin, the bag is wrapped in soft, lightweight mulberry silk and accented with a removable silk scarf charm. The densely woven twill silk boasts a smooth drape and rich, deep hues, striking a subtle balance with the crisp, structured leather trim—scholarly yet free-spirited.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
