    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The scarf features a red-and-white concentric circle pattern, with iconic CELINE symbols—the carriage crest, Paris's Arc de Triomphe, the Blason chain, the Triomphe handbag, the Lulu crescent bag, and the Cabas tote—woven into a vintage-gold chain. Above the central carriage crest reads \"Un Nom, un style\" (A Name, A Style), echoing Michael Rider's core philosophy in his debut show notes: \"Celine stands for quality, timelessness, and style.\"",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for a super-clear visual experience.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The side scarf charm injects a light, flowing rhythm into the bag. It can be detached via a metal buckle and worn as a standalone scarf accessory, adding a bright pop of color to any outfit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
