      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "From left to right: Nano, Small, Teen, Medium",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The interior is lined in soft, supple lambskin, with a central compartment, a zippered pocket, and front and back slip pockets. It can accommodate bulkier items like a notebook, wallet, and compact powder, while also organizing smaller essentials like phone, keys, and cards—a dream for organization enthusiasts. The innermost pocket is lined with the same silk scarf print as the exterior, creating a clever echo.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
